{"availability":"available","full":"adedejimakinde/yotext","name":"yotext","description":"A Python Library for orthographic normalization and diacritic restoration for Yorùbá text. Separates tone marks from underdots. It has zero dependencies with a CLI and a web demo.","category":"Developer tools","language":"Python","stars":3,"forks":0,"created":"2026-08-31T16:38:18Z","updated":"2026-09-11T17:22:00Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://yotext-demo.onrender.com/","topics":["african-languages","computational-linguistics","low-resource-languages","nlp","python","text-normalization","unicode","yoruba"],"demo":"https://yotext-demo.onrender.com/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-19T00:45:21.593Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-19T00:45:21.593Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-19T00:45:21.593Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-12T00:01:46.415Z","stars":3,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-18T04:59:42.808Z","stars":3,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-19T00:45:21.593Z","stars":3,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Orthographic normalization and diacritic handling for Yorùbá text. Zero runtime dependencies. Requires Python 3.9 or newer.","I had just finished the experiments for a paper comparing zero-shot prompting against fine-tuned models on Yorùbá sentiment analysis. Part of that work involved stripping diacritics from the text. Writing that preprocessing, I kept hitting the same problem in every tool I looked at. They treated tone marks and the underdot in ẹ, ọ, ṣ as one category called \"diacritics\" and removed both together.","They are not the same thing. The underdot changes the word. ẹ and e are different letters. Tone marks sit on top of a vowel and do not change which word it is."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/adedejimakinde/yotext/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"1049da7c064626e53a1236e934d2864cf389d96e96ba3f264e16fdd87b76c622","extractedAt":"2026-10-12T00:01:46.616Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-19T00:45:21.717Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Orthographic normalization and diacritic handling for Yorùbá text. Zero runtime dependencies. Requires Python 3.9 or newer.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/adedejimakinde/yotext/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"1049da7c064626e53a1236e934d2864cf389d96e96ba3f264e16fdd87b76c622","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/adedejimakinde/yotext/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-19T00:45:21.717Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-09-11T17:22:00Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/adedejimakinde/yotext/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-19T00:45:21.717Z","hash":"1049da7c064626e53a1236e934d2864cf389d96e96ba3f264e16fdd87b76c622","originalBytes":5052,"storedBytes":5052,"truncated":false},"lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-19T00:45:21.593Z","subjects":[],"platforms":[],"classification":{"version":4,"method":"local_rules","category":"Developer tools","subjects":[],"evidence":[],"platformEvidence":[],"platformSupport":"author_metadata_not_runtime_tested","suggestedSubjects":[],"reviewRequired":false},"demoHealth":{"url":"https://yotext-demo.onrender.com/","attemptedAt":"2026-10-16T16:09:22.569Z","probeVersion":3,"status":"unknown","consecutiveTemporaryFailures":6,"error":{"reason":"http_503","at":"2026-10-16T16:09:22.569Z"},"nextCheckAt":"2026-10-19T16:09:22.569Z"},"previewAttemptAt":"2026-10-16T16:09:22.569Z","previewCheck":{"url":"https://yotext-demo.onrender.com/","attemptedAt":"2026-10-16T16:09:22.569Z","consecutiveFailures":6,"status":"retry","reason":"http_503","nextCheckAt":"2026-10-19T16:09:22.569Z"},"qualityPriority":false,"repositoryId":1352636146,"repositoryAliases":[],"repositoryEtag":"W/\"f26a9e3f563632097fd3ccb54b8e9452cb9fafd1479d0d98e7132052be3500f3\"","repositoryEtagFor":"adedejimakinde/yotext","spaces":[]}